<title>USA: Illinois State Toll Highway $150 mln issue priced.</title>
<headline>Illinois State Toll Highway $150 mln issue priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said it priced $150 million of Illinois State Toll Highway Authority toll highway refunding revenue bonds, Series A 1996, with a top yield of 5.55 percent in 2009.</p>
<p>The bonds are FGIC insured.</p>
<p>ILLINOIS STATE TOLL HIGHWAY AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $150,540,000*</p>
<p>TOLL HIGHWAY REFUNDING REVENUE BONDS,</p>
<p>1996 SERIES A</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa / A1	    S&amp;P: AAA / A+    FITCH: AAA /AA-</p>
<p>FGIC INSURED</p>
<p>DATED: 09/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1997 DUE: 01/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>01/01/1997		2,900M    5.00  %    SEALED BID</p>
<p>01/01/1998	     16,000M    5.00  %    SEALED BID</p>
